WEBVTT

00:11:28.894 --> 00:11:32.563
Like, I support other women's right
to choose it voluntarily, like,

00:11:32.563 --> 00:11:34.676
if they enjoy it.

00:11:34.676 --> 00:11:37.509
Yeah, but, like, I see
myself going forward

00:11:37.509 --> 00:11:41.247
as more likely, like,
protecting sex workers',

00:11:41.247 --> 00:11:44.288
like, legal freedoms and rights.

00:11:44.288 --> 00:11:48.213
Yeah, so, like, basically,
I'm planning on becoming a lawyer.

00:11:50.133 --> 00:11:51.835
Right, class. (Laughter) (Applause)

00:11:51.835 --> 00:11:55.921
So these next two modules
are also circa 2016.

00:11:55.921 --> 00:11:59.915
One subject is an Irishwoman
with a particularly noteworthy

00:11:59.915 --> 00:12:02.847
relationship to this issue,